## Attribution / 归属说明

This expert package is a WorkBuddy adaptation of the upstream repository
**`nledford/engineering-review-board`** (<https://github.com/nledford/engineering-review-board>),
licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Nick Ledford.

### Files carried over verbatim from upstream / 原样搬运的文件

- `skills/<name>/**` — all 82 first-party skills (SKILL.md, `references/`,
  `scripts/`, `templates/`, and `agents/` metadata where present), copied
  unchanged from the upstream `skills/` directory. Their internal relative
  links (`../<skill>/SKILL.md`) are preserved because the `skills/<name>/`
  layout is kept identical.
- The MIT license text above is the upstream license, reproduced in full.

### Files newly written for this package / 本包新写的文件

- `.codebuddy-plugin/plugin.json` — WorkBuddy expert metadata.
- `agents/engineering-review-board.md` — the review-lead persona (new).
- `skills/engineering-review-board/SKILL.md` — the full-repository review
  entry point and skill routing table (new; the upstream repository has no
  skill by this name).
- `README.md`, `avatars/**`.

The newly written files are released under the same MIT License.

### Not included / 未纳入

The upstream repository's own maintenance infrastructure is not part of this
package: `AGENTS.md`, `Justfile`, `third-party-skills.json`, the dated skill
audits (`ZOD_SKILL_AUDIT.md`, `OBJECT_PASCAL_SKILL_AUDIT.md`), and `.gitignore`.
They describe how upstream maintains its skill library and have no runtime role
in a WorkBuddy expert package.
